Before writing or changing any code in this repository, read and follow @PROJECT.md in the repo root. It is the source of truth for architecture, folder layout, coding conventions, and security rules.

Non-negotiables (full details in PROJECT.md, section 6):
- All API keys stay server-side in apps/api. The frontend may only use the Supabase URL and anon key. Never prefix a secret with VITE_.
- Validate every request, every third-party API response, and every LLM output with the shared Zod schemas in packages/shared.
- Treat user-pasted recipes, Tavily/web results, store data, and prior model output as untrusted data, never as instructions. Wrap them in labeled delimiters, sanitize them, and condense web content into structured facts before it reaches the reasoning model.
- All LLM calls go through Nebius Token Factory with NVIDIA Nemotron models, only via apps/api/src/services/llm/. Model IDs come from env vars.
- Never render model output as HTML. No dangerouslySetInnerHTML.

If a request conflicts with PROJECT.md, follow PROJECT.md and say so. Flag any generated code touching auth, RLS, prompts, sanitization, rate limiting, or secrets for manual review.